{
  "_comment": [
    "Spec 549: where AIDE_INSTALL_CMD/installCmd is read from, as the table",
    "the dashboard's `resolveInstallCmd` is checked against.",
    "",
    "`.aide/config` is the only source read now: a manifest `installCmd:` is",
    "never read, even when `.aide/config` sets nothing.",
    "",
    "`value` is what `resolveInstallCmd` must resolve to. `source` is what it",
    "reports — always `.aide/config` or `null`. null in `config`/`manifest`",
    "means: the key is not written in that file at all."
  ],
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "config-only",
      "config": "echo config",
      "manifest": null,
      "value": "echo config",
      "source": ".aide/config"
    },
    {
      "name": "manifest-only-is-not-read",
      "config": null,
      "manifest": "echo manifest",
      "value": null,
      "source": null
    },
    {
      "name": "both-set-manifest-ignored",
      "config": "echo config",
      "manifest": "echo manifest",
      "value": "echo config",
      "source": ".aide/config"
    },
    {
      "name": "neither",
      "config": null,
      "manifest": null,
      "value": null,
      "source": null
    }
  ]
}
